## Agent close (gap phase)

- Deliver **mode** (A/B), updated `GAPS.md` path, derived slug (Mode B), and iteration stop reason.
- Count: FACT found | HYDRATED | INFERENCE | REJECTED | UNKNOWN; copy **`## Pending count`** table from `GAPS.md`.
- **Mandatory last line of chat (verbatim, integer only on the line):** `Gaps pending (mejora + apply): <N>` — must match `GAPS.md`; **nothing after this line**.
- **Stop line (before last line):** run `/mejora-tarea <slug>` if `<N> > 0`, else `/aplica-tarea <slug>` — only after user decides; not in the same turn unless explicitly requested.
